OL,3,GNEWSAReform urged to suspend conduct
OL,4,Abreach councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council's Reform
OL,7,FUK group has been urged to suspend a
OL,8,Fcouncillor who has refused to apologise
OL,9,Ffor breaches of the authority's code of
OL,10,Fconduct.
OL,12,FJoseph Boam was sanctioned after two
OL,13,Fcomplaints - lodged by former senior
OL,14,Fcouncil officer Lauren Haslam, and by
OL,15,FConservative councillor Ozzy O'Shea -
OL,16,Fwere upheld earlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
